---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About — Shain Carrasco" description="Shain Carrasco builds ML products, research tools for astronomy, and Roblox games in Chicago.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">About</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-muted">I'm Shain Carrasco, in Chicago. I build machine-learning products people actually use, research tools for astronomy, and Roblox games with a small studio.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted">How I work: each project gets a short spec with a cut line (what it will not do), an oracle test against something I trust, a benchmark with the machine and method written down, and a review pass that tries to break it before release. Claude writes much of the code from my specs; each README says how, and commits carry a Co-Authored-By trailer.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Stack</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-muted">Python · pandas · scikit-learn · XGBoost · LightGBM · Flask · PostgreSQL / Neon · TypeScript · React · Next.js · Astro · Go · Luau · MediaPipe · Playwright</p>
    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Contact</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-muted"><a href="https://github.com/shaincarrasco" class="text-text underline underline-offset-4">github.com/shaincarrasco</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>
